der the Responsibly Raised brand. In addition, the company provides digital ordering through its website, mobile app, and third-party delivery platforms. It operates in the United States, Canada, France, Germany, Mexico, the Middle East, South Korea, and the United Kingdom. Chipotle Mexican Grill, Inc. was founded in 1993 and is headquartered in Newport Beach, California.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Scott  Boatwright | CEO & Director | Age 52 | Compensation: $2.5M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 140K people. Revenue per employee of $85K ranks in the bottom quartile among Consumer Cyclical peers, with revenue growing 14%/yr across its filed history. Each employee generates $10K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $854 per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 29\u00d7 revenue per employee (reasonable relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (2/10).","financial_summary":["Chipotle Mexican Grill, Inc. is a large-cap consumer cyclical business with a $47.2B market cap on $11.9B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +11% over the past three years, a respectable pace for a business of this size.","Returns on capital run at 73% against a 9% cost of capital \u2014 a 64-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","The business throws off $1.4B in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 12 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 1.38\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and interest coverage of 40\u00d7 is fortress-like.","Management returns a meaningful 5.1% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, a strong signal of disciplined capital allocation, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and within its sector the business captures 2.1\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 65% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away (confirmed by 2 other valuation measures)","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.6479400663232847},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Consumer staples outperforming discretionary, signaling cautious spending","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Consumer demand is fundamentally cyclical \u2014 a recession compresses both unit volume and pricing power, and operating leverage cuts both ways.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"E-commerce margin compression and tariff exposure \u2014 digital competition erodes pricing power while trade policy reshuffles supply-chain cost structures overnight.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Brand relevance decay \u2014 shifting consumer preferences and social-media-driven trends can strand inventory and invalidate positioning faster than product cycles can adapt.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Operating margins 9% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","ROIC sits in the top quartile of Consumer Cyclical peers \u2014 the moat is wider than the neighbourhood","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk","Consumer Cyclical sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 8% over 3 months"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Can Chipotle Mexican (NYSE:CMG) Sustain Growth Amid Softer Consumer Demand?","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/stocks/consumer/can-chipotle-mexican-nysecmg-sustain-growth-amid-softer-consumer-demand","date":"2026-11-27","timestamp":1795797480.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.62,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Why Is Chipotle (CMG) Up 19.6% Since Last Earnings Report?","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/why-chipotle-cmg-19-6-153008886.html","date":"2026-11-27","timestamp":1795793408.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Why Did Chipotle Mexican Grill (CMG) Move Today?","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/consumer-services/nyse-cmg/chipotle-mexican-grill/news/why-did-chipotle-mexican-grill-cmg-move-today","date":"2026-11-25","timestamp":1795633829.727,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.658,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"ASX Temporarily Halts Trading of Critical Minerals Group (CMG) Securities on 25 November 2026","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/au/news/announcements/asx-temporarily-halts-trading-of-critical-minerals-group-cmg-securities-on-25-november-2026","date":"2026-11-24","timestamp":1795562102.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.026,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Are Wall Street Analysts Bullish on Chipotle Mexican Grill Stock?","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/wall-street-analysts-bullish-chipotle-155905969.html","date":"2026-11-27","timestamp":1795795145.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.7,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Thanksgiving Day hours: What\u2019s open and closed across grocery, retail and restaurants","source":"foxbusiness.com","link":"https://www.foxbusiness.com/lifestyle/thanksgiving-day-hours-whats-open-closed-across-grocery-retail-restaurants","date":"2026-11-25","timestamp":179561626